  {
    "published_source_revision": "6a888f9dc4155b9ec1407b27223eb37218957159",
    "source_path": "TranscendentalNakamaye/blueprint/src/hironaka-smooth-centre-real-domain-actual-ambient-hs-extension.tex",
    "source_sha256": "e4e4f182394f805c33ee5f984ec29ae68d781903c373dd44237b06a50d424529",
    "source_kind": "complete_original_statement_and_proof_fragment",
    "selected_original_source_sha256": "a1fa5bb777e8817d8c19cf7b69573fc443ae4059d9dc164ed1be6b4a5e1fba82",
    "selected_original_source": "\\begin{theorem}[Every true local complex algebra equivalence preserves all original ambient jet quotients]\n\\label{hir:smooth-centre-actual-whole-ambient-jet-transport}\n\\lean{TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.HironakaSmoothCentreRealDomainActualAmbientHS.actualLocalAmbientJetAlgEquiv,TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.HironakaSmoothCentreRealDomainActualAmbientHS.actualLocalAmbientJetAlgEquiv_mk,TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.HironakaSmoothCentreRealDomainActualAmbientHS.actualAmbientHS_eq_of_genuineAlgEquiv}\n\\leanok\nFor every genuine complex algebra equivalence $E:R\\simeq_{\\mathbb C}S$\nbetween actual local complex germ algebras, every original ideal $I$ and\nevery $s\\geq0$, it gives a genuine complex algebra isomorphism\n$R/(I+\\mathfrak m_R^s)\\simeq_{\\mathbb C}\nS/(E(I)+\\mathfrak m_S^s)$. Every original numerator maps to its SAME\nactual $E$ image. Thus the actual ambient Hilbert--Samuel values agree at\nevery order.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\nAn actual ring equivalence preserves units and nonunits in both directions.\nThe unique original maximal ideals therefore satisfy\n$E(\\mathfrak m_R)=\\mathfrak m_S$. The true whole ideal map preserves powers\nand sums, giving the full denominator image equality. The genuine quotient\nalgebra universal property constructs the whole complex algebra isomorphism,\nwith its inverse induced by the SAME original inverse map. Its actual\nquotient formula retains every original representative. Restricting its\noriginal algebra action to complex scalars proves equality of actual complex\ndimensions. Apply this at exponent $s=\\ell+1$ to the existing ambient\nHilbert--Samuel definition.\n\\end{proof}\n\n\\begin{theorem}[A fixed real nonlinear flattening retains the actual original chart-stalk ambient function]\n\\label{hir:smooth-centre-fixed-real-original-ambient-hs-dictionary}\n\\uses{hir:smooth-centre-actual-whole-ambient-jet-transport,hir:real-domain-fixed-flattening-all-original-whole-stalks}\n\\lean{TranscendentalNakamaye.Pending.HironakaSmoothCentreRealDomainActualAmbientHS.fixed_real_original_whole_stalk_ambient_hs_dictionary}\n\\leanok\nFor the actual original coherent ideal $A$, a fixed genuine flattening\n$\\Phi$, every actual target point $a\\in\\Phi.\\mathrm{target}$ and original\npoint $y=\\Phi^{-1}(a)$ in its true chart source, the actual translated\nflattened origin ideal $I_a$ and the WHOLE original chart-stalk ideal\n$A_y$ have identical ambient Hilbert--Samuel functions at all orders.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\nUse the actual original whole stalk map and comap dictionary, constructed\nfrom genuine finite original coherent generators and their true nonlinear\nholomorphic images on the real target. The genuine recentered nonlinear\ngerm equivalence maps the entire original $I_a$ onto the original $A_y$.\nApply the preceding whole maximal-power quotient transport. Its whole\ncomplex scalar map is the actual original germ pullback. No finite jet,\nideal equality or Hilbert--Samuel comparison is supplied by a caller.\n\\end{proof}\n",
    "destination_path": "blueprint/hironaka-original-fixed-real-ambient-hs-dictionary-support.tex",
